# Persian additive clock half: "ساعت دو و نیم" == two-and-a-half == 02:30,
# the half counted PAST the named hour.
# Citation 1: UT Austin, Persian Online Resources, "To Tell the Time" --
# "ساعت دو و نیم است" (sa'at do-vo nim ast) == "It is two-thirty."
# https://sites.la.utexas.edu/persian_online_resources/numbers-1/to-tell-the-time/
# Citation 2: talkpal.ai, "Telling Time in Persian Language" -- "4:30 -
# ساعت چهار و نیم (sa'at-e chahar va nim)".
# https://talkpal.ai/vocabulary/telling-time-in-persian-language/
نیم
